545
00:21:17,210 --> 00:21:20,257
Third, the recall status for any used

546
00:21:20,257 --> 00:21:20,751
truck.

547
00:21:20,931 --> 00:21:23,461
And fourth, the towing and payload on

548
00:21:23,461 --> 00:21:24,623
